# {{.Name}}

A service written in [effect-go](https://github.com/effect-go/effect-go).

```bash
ego test ./...        # regenerate, then go test
go run .              # serves on :8080 (ADDR to change it)
curl localhost:8080/hello/ada
```

- `.ego` files are the source. `ego generate` writes the `_ego.go` files
  next to them: plain Go, committed, never edited by hand.
- [AGENTS.md](AGENTS.md) is the whole language on one page, for people and
  coding agents.
- `ego eject -w ./...` turns the project into plain Go for good.
